  "prompt": "Build an original dependency-free static slider matching v4 tile 89:246 in a372×264 Stage. Use a324×168 native plane at reference origin24,20 and a400×520 full composition with the complete368×320 original model and all original copy. Native is the exact10×160 vertical groove,eleven supplied tick SVGs,the44×30 ribbed cap with60×46 shadow root and6×72 orange fill. Preserve the complete cap SVG including all three ribs. Value0 maps to centre175px and100 to45px; seed58.461538 places the cap at99px. Fill keeps its original bottom cap at186px,with unchanged6×72 SVG roots,cropped interiors and a translated upper cap. Native relative input uses the explicit100/130 camera and preserves the original dy+.35dx law. Full remains the complete original rotary Volume control:114px bezel,76px knob,5px orange marker,initial value50 and every original key/drag/clamp/angle equation. Replace its old100ms linear paint with canonical interruptible view motion. Keep literal original clamps,all six/three detents,keys,Page steps,pointer rules and complete full source state. Full input proxies preserve original labels,focus and capture outside the painted planes. Retain the actual painted node in both modes when opacity-fading; clone becomes live. Use the live plane for view variables. Keep the full source field unselectable so native text drag never cancels a gesture. Source thumb paths are0.2 for Dot/Stepper and0.1 for Volume; never assume child order. Direct dragging has no transition; release uses stiffness380/damping32/mass1 with actual pointer velocity and.55 rubber-banding. Reduced changes use150ms retained opacity feedback with stable focus rings and unchanged compositing. Preserve source attribution, local fonts,44px physical hit height and at least11px optical text. Stage owns Drag and fitting; no outer panel or private replay button. Suspend independent source/view clocks under caller, document and full viewport holds; queue intent while consuming recognized keys immediately. Dispose listeners, observers, frames, actual capture, hidden geometry probes, easing samplers and retained layers. Offline exports require no runtime library or network.",
