  "prompt": "Build an original dependency-free static volume control matching v4 tile 89:281 in a372×264 Stage. Native uses a324×168 plane at24,20; full is400×520 with the complete368×320 original model and copy. Native preserves the16×160 empty groove and40px round white floating head with its unchanged56px shadow root. The exact captured head centre is186,92. Values0/100 map to170/50px through a120px travel camera; native starts at65. Full keeps the original140px empty270-degree arc,all seven calibration ticks,106px knob and10px orange marker. Preserve all literal original relative equations: upward delta plus0.35 times rightward delta,clamp0..100,Home/End,arrows5,Page20 and angle -135+2.7*value. Full initial value is0; source knob paths0.8/0.0/0.1 are distinct. Keep all8 SVG bytes and roots unchanged. Inputs remain stable proxies outside the retained painted planes; copy focus to the current full plane and write view variables to that live plane. Direct dragging follows real scaled input without transitions; release carries meaningful pointer velocity into380/32/1 springs with0.55 rubber-banding. Reduced state changes retain actual paint and opacity-fade150ms with the canonical curve. Keep one analytic transport segment,drain unpainted source style traces after rendering,and prune quantization-invisible fade planes during sustained input. Preserve44px physical hit regions,11px optical full typography,local fonts,all original attribution and complete exports. Stage owns Drag and fitting. Caller,document and full viewport holds independently freeze source/view clocks and queue intent while consuming recognized keys. Dispose capture,listeners,observers,frames,easing samplers and retained planes. No runtime dependency or network is required.",
